The question remains whether this will ever see an official release in India. Historically, GWPs don't always make it to our shores through official channels, often requiring import or a trip abroad. As a gift with purchase, 40899 isn't sold on its own anywhere, so it has no retail price.

Because it has no price of its own, there's no import cost to estimate. Neither Toycra nor MyBrickHouse is expected to stock it, which makes it import only for now.

It’s a cool looking model, no doubt. But as a GWP, its availability in India is highly questionable. If you absolutely must have it, prepare to pay a premium on the secondary market or through unofficial channels.

