UPDATE public.news_articles SET content = $boi_t$Your August LEGO haul just got a little more interesting, and your wallet might be preparing for impact. LEGO is rolling out a fresh wave of Gift With Purchase (GWP) promotions starting late August 2026, bringing back some popular items and introducing bundle deals. It’s the perfect time to snag those sets you’ve been eyeing, especially with the Back to Hogwarts campaign looming.

