No official LEGO India pricing has been confirmed for these GWPs, since LEGO doesn't sell them separately. Two are listed on their own by an Indian store: MyBrickHouse has the 40894 Koenigsegg Sadair’s Spear Steering Wheel at ₹2,499 (in stock as of 29 Sep 2026) and 40893 Grond at ₹2,999 (out of stock as of 29 Sep 2026). Keep an eye on MyBrickHouse and Toycra for the others, though these are often limited to specific regions.

These promotions run until August 28th in most regions, with the UK/EU Botanical Garden offer lasting until October 1st. It's a good opportunity to top up your collection before the big LEGO Harry Potter event kicks off on August 29th.

