Despite some criticisms regarding minifigure count and stylistic differences from the original, the new sail and shield elements are receiving praise. The inclusion of brown elements and clever SNOT (Studs Not On Top) techniques for the castle turret pieces are also noted positively. For those who missed out on the original or long for that castle theme nostalgia, this set holds significant appeal. The challenge, as always with GWPs, will be meeting the spending requirement without feeling like you're overpaying for unwanted bricks. Given the GWP nature and no confirmed set price, this is unlikely to be available through standard Indian retail channels.

